# Search-only exclusions for ripgrep/fd-style tools (files stay tracked in Git).
# These are archived journals or generated/vendor data. Reading them whole wastes
# context; use `rg --no-ignore` when history is genuinely needed.

# Archived journals and pre-shared-tree records.
**/docs/history/

# Packaged manager/release inputs (large binaries and duplicated style data).
**/docs/manager/packages/

# Generated or vendored source blobs; logic lives elsewhere.
**/source/fw.h
**/source/HZK12.h
**/source/Newest_FW_ver.h
**/ff15/ffunicode.c
**/fatfs/ffunicode.c
**/*.pack
**/*.hex
**/*.bin
**/*.gba
